    "serial": null,
    "original_requirement": "实现一个温湿度与风扇联动系统，使用 DHT11（D7）、风扇 PWM 引脚 D5、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和按钮 D2。默认显示温度，每按一次按钮切换显示温度或湿度；当温度高于 30℃ 时自动打开风扇并根据温度升高程度提升转速。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个温湿度与风扇联动系统，使用 DHT11（D7）、风扇 PWM 引脚 D5、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D3）和按钮 D2。默认显示温度，每按一次按钮切换显示温度或湿度；当温度高于 30℃ 时自动打开风扇并根据温度升高程度提升转速。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v1\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"pwm_output\", \"pin\": \"D5\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"dht\", \"pin\": \"D7\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D3\"}], \"serial\": null}",
